WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.903
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.204
And if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:07.706
Former president Trump
pleaded not guilty yesterday

00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:11.177
to 34 charges of
falsifying business records.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.246
Well, his voice pleaded
not guilty.

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.815
His face pleaded
guilty as hell.

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.683
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:19.586
Former president Trump
spoke last night

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.521
at Mar-a-Lago
following his arraignment

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.190
and said, "I never
thought anything like this

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.759
could happen in America."
Honestly, neither did I.

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:30.864
I mean, you got away with
so many crimes for so long.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.965
Trump getting arrested
was like "Avatar 2."

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:35.902
I just figured it was
never going to happen.

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:37.336
Then it finally did,
and I was like,

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:38.872
you know what? Worth the wait.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.006
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.341
In his speech at Mar-a-Lago

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:42.675
last night
after his arraignment,

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.543
former president Trump
thanked his family

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:46.545
and said,
"I have a great family

00:00:46.545 --> 00:00:50.149
and they've done a fantastic job
and we appreciate it very much."

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:53.486
Great that he likes his family.
But why does he talk about them

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:57.257
the way a high school principal
talks about the prom committee?

00:00:57.257 --> 00:00:59.392
They've done a great job.
We really appreciate them.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:02.862
And, you know, it looks like
we're under the sea.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.597
Give them a hand.

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:07.333
Eric Trump retweeted a photo
of former president Trump

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.635
in court yesterday
with the caption, "Boss!"

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:11.471
No, dude, it's your father.
What?

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:13.005
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:16.342
What is wrong
with this family?

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.544
After former president Trump's
post-arraignment event

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:20.012
at Mar-a-Lago last night,

00:01:20.012 --> 00:01:23.315
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene said that

00:01:23.315 --> 00:01:26.118
Trump was "committed like
she's never seen him before."

00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:28.988
Well, yeah, but that's
a pretty low benchmark.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.490
If he was committed before,

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.425
he wouldn't be in this mess
to begin with.

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.160
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.362
Fox News chairman
Rupert Murdoch has reportedly

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.863
called off his engagement.

00:01:37.863 --> 00:01:41.334
And just as his leg was healing
from getting down on one knee.

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:45.038
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:47.773
That's right. 92-year-old
Fox News chairman

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:50.175
Rupert Murdoch has reportedly
called off his engagement.

00:01:50.175 --> 00:01:52.712
Yeah, don't rush into anything.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.614
You've got your whole month
ahead of you.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:57.283
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.952
Lawmakers in Texas
are considering two new bills

00:01:59.952 --> 00:02:02.655
that would allow firearm safety
to be taught in high school

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:05.258
and, if there's money
left over, math.

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:07.227
[ Laughter ]

